OL,3,GNEWSABoy and girl, 13, held after
OL,4,A'volatile' gathering
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 13-year-olds have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter police officers were injured
OL,8,Fduring a "challenging and volatile
OL,9,Fsituation" amid a gathering of more
OL,10,Fthan 60 young people.
OL,12,FThree officers were hurt after youths
OL,13,Fgathered in Cadishead on 29 October and
OL,14,Fa property was damaged, Greater
OL,15,FManchester Police said. Two nights
OL,16,Flater another big group on Liverpool
OL,17,FRoad were reportedly setting off
OL,18,Ffireworks.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
