OL,3,GNEWSABoy and girl, 13, held after
OL,4,A'volatile' gathering
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy, 13, has been held on suspicion
OL,7,Fof violent disorder, assault
OL,8,Foccasioning actual bodily harm and two
OL,9,Fcounts of assaulting an emergency
OL,10,Fworker.
OL,12,FA girl, also 13, has been held on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of violent disorder and
OL,14,Fperverting the course of justice. The
OL,15,Fpair are being questioned in police
OL,16,Fcustody.
